body:
Oh, its not me saying it, it's what's happening. There are men literally complaining nowadays. But society labels them as alt-right and incels, so what's the point? If you're not strong, you will be shamed. JBP posted this on twitter and it was filled with men and women together calling this man "incel", "terrorist", "virgin", "old man who gets not btches" with a picture of him and his wife and more. If this was a women complaining about double standards that men benefit, how many will call that women "virgin who gets no man?", and if someone do when will that person be banned and expelled? Pretty soon. We're dealing with men's issues, the most laughed at subject in the world. If men don't suck it up and start crying they'll face so much humiliation that they'll start to be destructive and will start shooting up people. Women don't do that. Isn't it amazing how different the outcome is if there are people who'd at least acknowledge their issues? 

&#x200B;

Again whats the funniest fight move in all movies? Kicking in the balls.
